<title>NEW ZEALAND: PDL NZ$20 mln bond issue closes fully subscribed.</title>
<headline>PDL NZ$20 mln bond issue closes fully subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PDL Holdings said on Friday its NZ$20 million bond issue had been fully subscribed and the offer was now closed.</p>
<p>Listing of the bonds on the New Zealand Stock Exchange is expected to commence from September 9.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
